.Dd November 16, 2026
.Dt ZCAT 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm zcat
.Nd write expanded .Z LZW files to standard output
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar file ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility decodes historical `.Z` LZW streams and writes the bytes to standard output.
A missing
.Ql .Z
suffix is added when reading; input files are not removed.
.Pp
The target image requires a file operand; standard input is not available.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
A corrupt stream or I/O error exits with status 1; a usage error exits with status 2.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr compress 1 ,
.Xr uncompress 1
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD implements the historical block-mode `.Z` LZW format.
